{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794469418","published":"2026-11-12T07:43:50Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:17:29.343111290Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-93479","CVE-2026-97205"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-93479, CVE-2026-97205","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in the script engine when the\n     formatted output spills into the reserved area\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93479.patch: compute the formatted length in\n       ngx_http_script_run() and ngx_stream_script_run() separately from the\n       reserved length, so the recalculated value length can no longer\n       exceed the allocated buffer\n     - CVE-2026-93479\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free via an 8-bit pending operation counter\n     wrapping around\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-97205.patch: add NGX_HTTP_MAX_BLOCKED (250);\n       beyond it, file reads in the copy filter and the file cache are done\n       synchronously, and cache lock waits and upstream thread tasks are\n       refused, so r->main->blocked can no longer overflow\n     - CVE-2026-97205","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-0ubuntu1.7+tuxcare.els11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1794469418.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-0ubuntu1.7+tuxcare.els11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1794469418.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libng